  <section>
    <h2>Behaviour in Amstelvar Avar2</h2>
    <p>
      Amstelvar Avar2 uses GRAD to alter overall stroke darkness while keeping
      advance width, spacing, proportion, and glyph placement as stable as
      possible. The result changes the colour of text without functioning as a
      conventional weight transformation.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Straight construction — H</h2>
    <p>
      The stems and crossbar become lighter or darker
      while the glyph’s width and underlying skeleton remain stable.
    </p>

